-- LUẬT CHẤM THEO MẪU MỚI (anh 03/11/2026: "Mech King -> Sửa luật chấm !!" + "Sửa cả tiêu chí CTA"):
-- (1) afs.cta: CTA mẫu Kiên là mặc định (cat-canh.py MAU_CTA) — video sạch, ô tên phim + "WATCH NOW" 5 giây cuối, không thẻ poster, không giọng → điểm 10;
--     mẫu cũ (thẻ poster + WHAT HAPPENS NEXT? + WATCH FREE · LEARN MORE) vẫn 10. Bộ chấm cho mẫu Kiên 4–5/10 vì đòi thẻ cuối cũ (#64963 / #64967 / #64969 / #64972 / #64975).
-- (2) meta.bao_luc + afs.an_toan: robot / mecha / giáp / máy móc khoa học viễn tưởng đánh nhau, võ thuật, hành động fantasy KHÔNG máu / vết thương / chết người
--     không phải bạo lực (Mech King #64970 bị chấm bạo lực 3 vì robot đấu).
UPDATE etp.tieu_chi SET mo_ta = 'Allowed CTA templates — score 10 for EITHER: (a) the house template now in use: the video plays clean with NO button during the story, and only in the LAST ~5 seconds a dark box near the bottom shows the drama title (yellow) and one red button reading exactly "WATCH NOW" / "VER AHORA" — no end card, no poster, no voice-over is REQUIRED; (b) the older template: end card with poster + drama title + "WHAT HAPPENS NEXT?" / "¿QUÉ PASA DESPUÉS?" + one button "WATCH FREE · LEARN MORE" / "MÍRALA GRATIS · MÁS INFORMACIÓN". A video with no end card at all is fine as long as the title box + button appear at the end. Deduct only for: Tap / Click / Toca, arrows, pointing hands or icons, countdowns, "limited time", FREE / GRATIS badges, fake system buttons, or extra CTA text.'
  WHERE nhom = 'afs' AND ma = 'cta';
UPDATE etp.tieu_chi SET mo_ta = 'Violent & Graphic Content: blood, injuries, gore, beating a person, a person tied up or restrained, death or dead bodies, real guns or knives aimed at people, words like kill / dead / murder. NOT violence (score high): robots, mecha, armor or sci-fi machines fighting each other, superhero / fantasy / magic action, martial-arts sparring or sports, explosions without hurt people — as long as no blood, wound or dead body is shown.'
  WHERE nhom = 'meta' AND ma = 'bao_luc';
UPDATE etp.tieu_chi SET mo_ta = 'Google advertiser brand safety (stricter than Meta): no sexual innuendo, real violence (blood, injury, people being hurt or killed), crime glorification, shocking or disturbing imagery anywhere in the video. Robots / mecha / sci-fi machine battles, fantasy or superhero action and martial arts WITHOUT blood, injury or death are brand-safe — do not deduct for them.'
  WHERE nhom = 'afs' AND ma = 'an_toan';
